      "source": "Note that this resolver will either resolve the version from the specified\npath segment, or raise an <a href=\"InvalidApiVersionException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.accept\"><code>InvalidApiVersionException</code></a>, e.g. if there\nare not enough path segments. It never returns <code>null</code>, and therefore\ncannot yield to other resolvers.",
      "translation": "请注意，此解析器将从指定的路径段中解析版本，或者抛出<a href=\"InvalidApiVersionException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.accept\"><code>InvalidApiVersionException</code></a>（例如，如果路径段不足）。它永远不会返回<code>null</code>，因此无法让其他解析器处理。",
